# Tools vs temp

| Path | Allowed |
|------|---------|
| `.cursor/tools/` | Reusable CLIs, `package.json`, shared libs |
| `.cursor/temp/<issue>/` | Tracker attachments, QA screenshots, short-lived evidence |

No `package.json` or mini-apps under `temp/`.

When work is finished: `node .cursor/tools/cli/temp-cleanup.mjs <ISSUE-KEY>`.
